---
import Doc from '../../../layouts/Doc.astro';
import Pager from '../../../components/Pager.astro';
const slug = 'reference/config-file';
---
<Doc slug={slug} title="Config file">
  <h1>Config file reference</h1>
  <p>cortex loads <code>~/.config/cortex/config.yaml</code>, then <code>./cortex.yaml</code>, with later fields taking precedence. <code>--config PATH</code> reads only that file.</p>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>Agent name shown in the terminal. Defaults to cortex.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>provider</code></td><td>Provider name defined in axon. Required.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>model</code></td><td>Model identifier within that provider. Required.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>system_prompt</code></td><td>Inline text or a path to a text file.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>pruner.provider</code>, <code>pruner.model</code></td><td>Optional model for context checkpoints. Empty uses the main model.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>explorer.provider</code>, <code>explorer.model</code>, <code>explorer.models</code></td><td>Optional read-only explorer and fallback models.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>mcp_servers</code></td><td>Map of subprocesses with <code>command</code>, <code>args</code>, and literal <code>env</code> entries.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p><code>LLM_PROVIDER</code> overrides <code>provider</code>, and <code>LLM_MODEL</code> overrides <code>model</code>. Provider URLs and credentials belong in axon config, not this file. See <a href="/cortex/docs/reference/api-keys/">API keys</a>.</p>
  <div class="docs-pager"><Pager slug={slug} /></div>
</Doc>
